          Your ultimate destination for product information, reviews, and smart shopping recommendations.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Links -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-semibold mb-4">Quick Links</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li><a href="/" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition text-sm">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition text-sm">Blog</a></li>
